<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Auth on Cribl Python SDK</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/sdks/auth/</link><description>Recent content in Auth on Cribl Python SDK</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/sdks/auth/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Tokens</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/sdks/auth/tokens/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/sdks/auth/tokens/</guid><description>&lt;p class="breadcrumb"&gt;Auth › Tokens&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;auth.tokens&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Authentication token operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.auth.tokens&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="get"&gt;get&lt;a class="anchor" href="#get"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;client.auth.tokens.get(...)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;Log in and fetch an authentication token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This endpoint is unavailable on Cribl.Cloud. Instead, follow the instructions at &lt;a href="https://docs.cribl.io/stream/api-tutorials/#criblcloud"&gt;https://docs.cribl.io/stream/api-tutorials/#criblcloud&lt;/a&gt; to get an Auth token for Cribl.Cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="example-usage"&gt;Example Usage&lt;a class="anchor" href="#example-usage"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# Example request body for logging in with a local username and password.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;client&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;auth&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;tokens&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;get(
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; username&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;yourUsername&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; password&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;yourPassword&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="parameters"&gt;Parameters&lt;a class="anchor" href="#parameters"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Parameter&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Required&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Default&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;username&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;str&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Yes&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Username of the account to authenticate&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;password&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;str&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Yes&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;—&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Password for the account&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
